   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Save the Children - DK</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att alla barn i Gulu-distriktet som har drabbats av konflikten i norra Uganda ska ges m&#xF6;jlighet att &#xE5;terg&#xE5; till ett normalt liv i sina lokalsamh&#xE4;llen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is that all children in Gulu district that have been affected by the conflict in Northern Uganda shall be given opportunity to be reintegrated in their local communities.</narrative>
  </description>
